# Local Worker variables for `wrangler dev` (copy to apps/api/.dev.vars, which
# Git ignores). Values here override wrangler.jsonc "vars". Secrets such as
# collector credentials go here locally and in `wrangler secret put` when
# deployed; never in wrangler.jsonc. Full reference: docs/observability.md.
#
# Export traces and metrics to a local OpenTelemetry Collector (OTLP/HTTP):
# OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER=otlp
# OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER=otlp
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318
# Bound of each OTLP request, 1-30000 ms (default 3000).
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_TIMEOUT=3000
# Collector credentials: comma-separated name=value pairs, values URL-encoded.
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS=authorization=Bearer%20local-dev-token
# OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG=1
# SERVICE_VERSION=0.0.0
# LOG_LEVEL=info
